WEBVTT

00:11:58.756 --> 00:12:01.175
and consider a strengths-based
approach instead.

00:12:02.009 --> 00:12:03.135
Second,

00:12:03.177 --> 00:12:08.557
make sure that there is a path
for career growth and promotion

00:12:08.599 --> 00:12:11.018
for your justice-involved employees.

00:12:11.351 --> 00:12:14.480
Now the insurance industry
is highly regulated,

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:16.565
and there are certain roles
due to licenses

00:12:16.607 --> 00:12:19.902
that may be off limits
for certain past offenses.

00:12:19.943 --> 00:12:22.404
We don’t want to hire someone
in an entry level

00:12:22.404 --> 00:12:24.865
only to find out
that they can't be promoted later.

00:12:24.907 --> 00:12:28.243
So make sure that there is
a clear path for growth and success

00:12:28.243 --> 00:12:29.411
in your company.